// Every text of the game in English (British), by key. A layout names one as "@main_menu.quit", the code asks for it
// with Localisation.Get("main_menu.quit"). Another language is another file in this folder with the same keys, what
// it leaves out comes out as the key, so a missing one is plain to see.
// A name in braces ({player}) is filled in by the game, keep it, move it about to wherever it goes in the sentence.
// [icon:pad_a] and friends are the buttons of whatever gamepad is in use, drawn as pictures, keep those too.

